{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm Lloid, a solo developer, and this game was a little passion project I built in my spare time.<br>You're <strong>alone</strong> in an <strong>abandoned mine</strong>, armed with nothing but a <strong>pickaxe</strong>.<br><br><strong>Mine</strong> through rocks, uncover <strong>rare minerals</strong>, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, and <strong>upgrade your gear</strong>... if you <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The deeper you go, the <strong>darker</strong> it gets.<br>Strange things <strong>dwell below the surface</strong>\u2014and they don't like visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mine. Progress. Fight.</strong> Discover what's <strong>buried in the dark</strong>.<br><strong>No timer. No mercy.</strong> Just you, your <strong>headlamp</strong>, and the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753910?t=1748504376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753910?t=1748504376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753910/90e43a4481b42ec272520eca9fd0c5b49ebe7241/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748504376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753910/90e43a4481b42ec272520eca9fd0c5b49ebe7241/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748504376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm Lloid, a solo developer, and this game was a little passion project I built in my spare time.<br>You're <strong>alone</strong> in an <strong>abandoned mine</strong>, armed with nothing but a <strong>pickaxe</strong>.<br><br><strong>Mine</strong> 